      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DIVOT (1) is worth forgiving for his last effort when fourth (22.93) at Geelong over 400m. Goes very well from this draw with six wins and two minor placings from nine starts. Should be very hard to beat this time. MISCHIEF MATE (2) finished fifth last time but the start prior broke the clock when winning over 410m at Horsham, taking a Grade 5 in a speedy 23.27. Should be in this for a long way. BUSH PROFIT (5) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing sixth (22.73) in a Grade 4/5 at this track. Form here sound including nine wins. Can measure up this time. BAROOGA KING (6) is among the chances again if he runs up to the latest effort.",
